Type: project
Package: ts
Title: TS Ubike Rental Program Project
Version: 0.0.1
Description: The package manifest for renv. renv is in "explicit" snapshot
    mode, so renv.lock tracks exactly the packages listed here. Everything is
    under Imports on purpose: renv treats Suggests as dev-only and leaves them
    out of the lockfile. Course packages come first; the rest are the course's
    optional extras (remotes, usethis, osmextract, stplanr) and the editor
    tooling (languageserver, for VS Code and nvim; vscDebugger, for VS Code's
    R Debugger; jgd, for vscode-R's plot pane). Add packages with
    `just add <pkg>` rather than editing this list by hand; for a GitHub
    package it also records the Remotes entry.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6)
Imports:
    sf,
    rmarkdown,
    openrouteservice,
    remotes,
    usethis,
    osmextract,
    stplanr,
    desc,
    languageserver,
    vscDebugger,
    jgd,
    readxl,
    tidyverse
Remotes:
    ManuelHentschel/vscDebugger
